                "comment": "she was cool but the 1 credit course was way more work than a 1 credit course should be. She is pretty funny and really nice.",
                "difficulty_rating": 5,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "A one credit course that was lightly graded. Weekly summaries of short readings, guest speakers, and even panelists on different biological issues. Interesting class. Because of the weekly guest speakers, it's hard to really say much about the professor.",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
